-- phoenix-waterproofing-and-projects-weavind-park (owner)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Phoenix Waterproofing and Projects is a Gauteng-based waterproofing and property-maintenance contractor operating from 133 De Bruyn Street in Weavind Park, Pretoria. The team works across liquid membrane, torch-on, epoxy, cementitious and green-roof waterproofing systems, alongside roof repairs, re-roofing, painting, gutter installation and repairs, barge, fascia and soffit work, Isotherm insulation fitting and ceiling repairs. Waterproofing projects specifically are backed by a five-year written warranty, giving clients cover well beyond the work itself.

As a privately held company founded in 2024, Phoenix Waterproofing and Projects serves both residential and commercial properties across Gauteng, handling jobs that range from a single waterproofing repair to a full re-roofing and painting project. The contractor is open Monday to Friday from 7am to 5:30pm, and Saturdays from 7am to 3pm, for site visits and quotes.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'phoenix-waterproofing-and-projects-weavind-park' AND description = 'Phoenix Waterproofing and Projects is a Weavind Park-based contractor offering waterproofing (liquid membrane, torch-on and epoxy systems), roof repairs, gutter work and interior/exterior painting, backed by a 5-year waterproofing warranty.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
